y:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.2pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;letter-spacing:-0.2pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">은 출석미달교과목 현황에서 조회되지 않아 출석미달</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.2pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;letter-spacing:-0.2pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">주의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.2pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;letter-spacing:-0.2pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">대상자에서 누락될 수 있으므로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.2pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;letter-spacing:-0.2pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">전자출결 앱에서 본인의 출결상황을 반드시 확인하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.2pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:34.8pt;text-indent:-34.8pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. LMS </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">동영상 강의 및 실시간 온라인 강의의 출결정보는 반영시기가 유동적일 수 있으며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">이에 따라 출석미달</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">주의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">대상이 아님에도 안내메세지가 발송될 수 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:35.7pt;text-indent:-35.7pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\"><b>조기취업자 출석인정승인자</b>의 경우 <b>최종승인(12월 중순)&nbsp;전</b>까지는 실제출결석 여부에 따라 출결상태가 입력되니 대상에 포함되어 메세지를 수신할 수 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:34.9pt;text-indent:-34.9pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">조기취업자 출석인정이 최종승인 완료되면 일괄출석 처리 되니 메세지를 수신하였을 경우 조기취업자출석인정 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">“</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">선승인</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">”</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">여부</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">를 우선 확인바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">마</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><b><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">출석미달 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">주의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">) </span></b><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\"><b>과목이 여러 개일 경우 메세지를 중복수신</b> 할 수 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">바</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\"><b>출결에 오류가 있을 시 해당과목 교수님에게 문의</b>하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">문의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-famil